<title>USA: Medtronic completes Clarus agreement.</title>
<headline>Medtronic completes Clarus agreement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medtronic Inc said it completed a license and technology transfer agreement with Clarus Medical Systems Inc.</p>
<p>The agreement covers products for endoscope-supported surgery. Specific terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Privately held Clarus, based here, makes minimally invasive, fiber-optic endoscopes that enable surgeons to visualize the operating site as they perform surgical procedures through small incisions.</p>
<p>Medtronic is the world's largest medical devices company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
